      "content": "Hey, I'm grading some essays for my AP World History class. One student wrote a thesis that says: \"National identity is a necessary tool for social cohesion and should be prioritized over globalist integration.\" Can you critique the logic of this argument for me? I want to give them some feedback on how they structured their reasoning.",
